# DNS Incident Analysis & Troubleshooting

## 📌 Project Overview
This project investigates a DNS resolution failure captured in a network packet log during a cybersecurity lab assignment. The objective is to analyze packet capture data, identify the root cause of the connection error, and propose a resolution.

